// Xayid — endless hunger. Three independent spawner streams instead of one
// larva pool: XayidDen breeds Worms, BiomassHatchery breeds Grubs, AvianNest
// breeds Wasps; training a unit consumes one from the matching stream and
// the worker is consumed when mutating structures (build_style Consume).
(
    name: "Xayid",
    build_style: Consume,
    life_regen_m: 270,
    units: [
        // ---- structures ----
        (name: "ScavengerNest", kind: Structure, hp: 1750, armor: 1, attrs: [Armored, Biological],
